  "details": "Currently you can place a trampoline over the spawn point, meaning anyone who joins is getting yeeted as soon as they load in. Besides being a bit disorienting for someone who might not have wanted to have that happen in certain maps with angled roofs or slanted floors this can lead to a soft trapping effect where the trampoline will repeatedly push the player back into the trampoline.\n\nFor one extreme example (https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_1fe147e9-c3e4-4606-b8f4-fa0a07298fb6/info) a trampoline at spawn will repeatedly launch a player out of an open airlock and into the void.",
